The first batch of our FOHAHOF CARES bags reached a total of 20 packs, which we have already delivered to the fire victims of Piapi Boulevard, Davao City, along with separate packs of sanitary napkins, diapers, and candies.

Thank you to all the volunteers, donors, and everyone behind this project. May we continue to extend this initiative and deliver these bags to every part of the Philippines. ❤️‍🩹

God bless us all!

